---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import EyeMark from './EyeMark.astro';
import Chevron from './Chevron.astro';

const REPO_HELPER = 'https://github.com/notkainoa/restless#how-lid-closed-mode-stays-passwordless';
---

<div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-16">
  <div data-reveal>
    <p class="t-label">How it stays passwordless</p>
    <h2 class="t-title mt-3">Approve once. <span class="text-ink-3">Never type your password again.</span></h2>
    <p class="t-lead mt-5">
      Keeping a Mac awake with the lid shut means flipping the system <code class="token">disablesleep</code>
      flag, which only <code class="token">root</code> can do. Restless hands that one job to a small,
      privileged helper.
    </p>

    <ol class="steps mt-8">
      <li>
        <span class="step-n">1</span>
        <span>The first time you turn on <b>Lid Closed <Chevron /> Keep Awake</b>, Restless offers to set the helper up.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="step-n">2</span>
        <span>
          Approve “Restless” once in <b>System Settings <Chevron /> General <Chevron /> Login Items &amp; Extensions</b>.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="step-n">3</span>
        <span>From then on the switch never asks for a password, and Auto-off at 20% can turn lid-closed mode off while you’re away.</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-reveal style="--d:1">
    <div class="flow card" data-flow>
      <div class="node">
        <EyeMark id="flow" size={40} />
        <div>
          <p class="node-title">Restless.app</p>
          <p class="node-sub">The menu bar app</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wire" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="wire-line"><span class="pulse"></span></span>
        <span class="wire-label"><Icon name="lock" size={12} /> XPC, same Developer ID team only</span>
      </div>

      <div class="node">
        <span class="node-icon"><Icon name="shield" size={20} /></span>
        <div>
          <p class="node-title">Privileged helper</p>
          <p class="node-sub">A <code>root</code> LaunchDaemon inside the app bundle</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wire" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="wire-line"><span class="pulse" style="animation-delay: 0.9s"></span></span>
        <span class="wire-label">Does exactly one thing</span>
      </div>

      <div class="node node-cmd">
        <span class="node-icon"><Icon name="terminal" size={20} /></span>
        <code class="cmd">pmset -a disablesleep 1</code>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="aside card">
      <p class="text-[0.9375rem] font-[600] tracking-[-0.01em]">Rather not install a helper?</p>
      <p class="t-body mt-1.5">
        Choose <b class="font-[580] text-ink">Just This Time</b>. The Mac stays awake now after a single password
        prompt, and nothing is installed. You can remove the helper anytime from the same System Settings pane.
      </p>
      <a href={REPO_HELPER} class="link mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.875rem] font-[540]">
        Read how the helper works
        <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={14} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  .steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.96875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .steps b {
    font-weight: 580;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .step-n {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    margin-top: -0.05rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 620;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--moon) 16%, transparent);
  }

  .flow {
    display: grid;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    background:
      radial-gradient(90% 60% at 100% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--moon) 10%, transparent), transparent 70%),
      var(--surface);
  }

  .node {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }

  .node-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }

  .node-title {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
  }

  .node-sub {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }

  .node-sub code {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .cmd {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .wire {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    padding-left: calc(1rem + 1.25rem - 1px);
  }

  .wire-line {
    position: relative;
    width: 2px;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* A message travelling down the wire. Composite-only: translateY of a
     full-height track, so the dot's position is relative to the wire. */
  .pulse {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    transform: translateY(-100%);
  }

  .pulse::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--accent));
  }

  :global(.is-in) .flow .pulse {
    animation: travel 3.6s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes travel {
    0% {
      transform: translateY(-100%);
    }
    30%,
    100% {
      transform: translateY(100%);
    }
  }

  .wire-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }

  .aside {
    padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(.is-in) .flow .pulse {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
